Z||000003||Bazooka||11-30-2001||04:02 PM||||Excellent poem. It especially illustrates a "New Morality" that has been instilled in the young people of our country. Its more clear that America represents fairness and justice, in contrast to the hypocracy of Bin Laden.||||reg||1
